@@@ KEYS

@@@ CONTENT
## Current Major Figures
- The figures are those of the current main stat, not the past. Description is based on these figures. The figures below are variables, so each request carries a different figure.
- HP : {{getvar::cv_hp}}
- Max HP : {{getvar::cv_maxHp}}
- Mana : {{getvar::cv_mana}}
- Max Mana : {{getvar::cv_maxMana}}
- hunger : {{getvar::cv_hunger}}
- Max Hunger : {{getvar::cv_maxHunger}}
- day : {{getvar::cv_day}}
- Dungeon Gate State (열림 / 도전중 / 닫힘): {{getvar::cv_dungeonGateState}}
- Dungeon Active (1 = inside dungeon, 0 = outside): {{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}
- facilities: {{getvar::cv_facilities}}
- points: {{getvar::cv_points}}
- items: {{getvar::cv_items}}
- skills (EQUIPPED - only these are active in combat / narration): {{getvar::cv_equippedSkills}}
- relics (EQUIPPED - only these grant stat bonuses): {{getvar::cv_equippedRelics}}
- skill_details (EQUIPPED full effects - use these for narration / mana resolution): {{getvar::cv_equippedSkillDetails}}
- relic_details (EQUIPPED full effects): {{getvar::cv_equippedRelicDetails}}

ABSOLUTE: items NOT in the equipped lists above are stored away and INACTIVE. Do NOT reference owned-but-unequipped skills / relics in narration, combat, or any roleplay. They simply do not exist from the player's combat perspective until equipped.
- companions: {{getvar::cv_companions}}

## ABSOLUTE — STAT VALUE SOURCE OF TRUTH (state desync 차단)
The `{{getvar::cv_*}}` values above + the STATUS_PANEL block are the SOLE source of truth for HP / MANA / HUNGER / POINTS / ATK / DEF / LUCK at this moment.
- When narrative or [SYS_NARR:] / [SYS_ADVICE:] / character dialogue references a numeric stat (e.g. "체력 N 남았다", "마나 N", "현재 체력: N/100"), use the EXACT current variable value above. NEVER fabricate or estimate.
- DO NOT carry over old chat-history values. If MANA was 20 three turns ago but cv_mana is now 100 (variable edit / recharge / item), narrate it as 100 — not 20.
- DO NOT lower a value for dramatic effect. If you want low-HP / mana-empty drama, only narrate it WHEN the variable is actually low. Fictional shortfalls confuse the player and desync from STATUS_PANEL.
- Same for items / facilities / equipped skills / equipped relics: reference ONLY what is in the lists above. "갖고 있는 N" / "장착된 N" references must match the variables exactly.
